                            </Translate>
                            <span class="from">2024 
                            <Translate>
                                <English>oct. – present</English>
                                <Hungarian>okt. – jelen</Hungarian>
                            </Translate>
                        </span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="tech">ASP.NET Core · Entity Framework Core · OpenID Connect</div>
                        <Translate>
                            <English>
                                <p>
                                    I created and lead the development of a website that collects news and events from
