                        <Translate>
                            <English>2017, 2018, <a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/XFj2AEYG5a4FQ9k68">2019</a></English>
                            <!-- TODO: Hungarian translation -->
                        </Translate>
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        <Translate>
                            <English>
                                Designed and programmed LEGO robots that completed autonomous tasks, reaching better
